      "kind": "text",
      "title": "Land the burst on their healer's CC",
      "body": "The Monk and DK usually burst together. It killed when their healer was locked out or kicked during those 6 seconds (3 of 5 at this level) and rarely when their healer was free (1 of 7). The attached build is the one he played in 2 of 7 games; the rest differed in a few talents and the third PvP talent (Grapple Weapon 4, Ride the Wind 3)."
